190:**Temperatures bring marginal influence.** To assess model robustness against temperatures, we evaluate temperatures 0.5 and 1.0 for three models: GPT-4.1-2025-04-14, GPT-4o-2024-11-20, and GPT-4o-Mini-2024-07-18. As shown in Table 2, the overall performance fluctuates only marginally across temperature settings, and the total score remains stable, indicating that our conclusions are not sensitive to the choice of decoding temperature.
